{
  "_readme": [
    "Curriculum → core skills. Seeded into the EXISTING ProgramSkill join table",
    "(LearningProgram → Skill) by `npm run db:seed:curriculum-skills`.",
    "",
    "`program` is LearningProgram.slug. Every Klymb AI track already has one:",
    "the four 60-day challenges and the AI cohort were given LearningProgram",
    "rows by the 078 migration (migrate-2d-learning-content.ts), and the newer",
    "cohorts create their own in their seed scripts.",
    "",
    "Only CORE skills belong here — what a recruiter would accept as 'this",
    "person was taught that'. Not every tool, lesson or minor topic. Each list",
    "was read off the real content in prisma/content/, not invented.",
    "",
    "TO ADD A NEW COHORT/CHALLENGE: add an entry with its LearningProgram slug",
    "and re-run the seed. Anyone who already meets the completion bar picks the",
    "new skills up on their next profile load — nothing is copied per user.",
    "",
    "`category` is a SkillCategory slug and is only applied when the seed has",
    "to CREATE the skill; an existing catalog row keeps its own category."
  ],

